increase your ranking!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Key Features: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addicting turn based combat system with psychedelic visuals! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+10 talents, each with their own unique skills and mechanics to use in combat or within the overworld.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique cities, each representing different iconic eras of Americana glamour and decay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comedic and absurdist story about celebrities, fame, and the death of monoculture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique dialogue choices with branching narrative paths...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random horror elements thrown in to freak out children and give them sleep paralysis nightmares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life-sim elements with a day/night time management system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of companions to recruit to your entourage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of minigames associated with each talent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectables that affect gameplay: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cassette tapes unlock new songs for musicians to  perform during battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special ingredients allow chefs to create dishes with unique buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magicians can find tarot and playing cards to create a custom deck  to use in fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much, much more!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lots of other dumb mechanics I forgot to mention!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world controlled by the entertainment industry, <i>The Star Corporation</i> has created a database that ranks every citizen based on their talents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Your dream is to become the greatest actor the world has ever seen.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303410/extras/4809a397387a0007bc1c019602f1690b.poster.avif?t=1780196537\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303410/extras/4809a397387a0007bc1c019602f1690b.webm?t=1780196537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303410/extras/4809a397387a0007bc1c019602f1690b.mp4?t=1780196537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Journey across the country as you learn new talents and skills!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303410/extras/dccddd5283c5bd632182df560b7a12ca.poster.avif?t=1780196537\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303410/extras/dccddd5283c5bd632182df560b7a12ca.webm?t=1780196537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303410/extras/dccddd5283c5bd632182df560b7a12ca.mp4?t=1780196537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Battle cutthroat competition to increase your ranking!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Key Features: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addicting turn based combat system with psychedelic visuals! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+10 talents, each with their own unique skills and mechanics to use in combat or within the overworld.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique cities, each representing different iconic eras of Americana glamour and decay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comedic and absurdist story about celebrities, fame, and the death of monoculture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique dialogue choices with branching narrative paths...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random horror elements thrown in to freak out children and give them sleep paralysis nightmares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life-sim elements with a day/night time management system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of companions to recruit to your entourage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of minigames associated with each talent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectables that affect gameplay: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cassette tapes unlock new songs for musicians to  perform during battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special ingredients allow chefs to create dishes with unique buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magicians can find tarot and playing cards to create a custom deck  to use in fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much, much more!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lots of other dumb mechanics I forgot to mention!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A psychedelic RPG set in the cutthroat world of the entertainment industry. Climb the ranks and become the greatest celebrity the world has ever seen!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303410/9e3415a3c2837ae763eead13789a47cc4bf8a5f3/header.jpg?t=1780196537", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303410/5f85e47683ffd8c3c6d8d024beea2ca9212a4056/c